 the ancient relics the
 Federation dug up. They're」
{next}
「another set of gods, the
 gods of the constellations...」
{next}
「An ancient book says this:」
{next}
Darkness overflowed the land
and malice filled the sky. The
sun had already vanished, and
{next}
men trembled in a
night without end.
{next}
Ah, but behold! Though the
sun be lost, we still have the
stars twinkling in the heavens!
{next}
The stars heard the people's
prayers, descended to the
earth, and took the form of
{next}
twelve stone statues...
{next}
These are the Zodiac Gods.
{FF04}{end}

